        "TileImage": "$($repository 9bebb40a-3746-4ba2-8bfc-a1fcabaec72c).Image",
        "Description": "Having discovered that Erich Soders has been secretly colluding with the organization known as Providence, the ICA Board of Directors has contracted 47 to eliminate Soders.\r\rSoders suffers from Situs Inversus and has used his connections with Providence to secure himself a new heart and a surgery at the GAMA hospital in Hokkaido, Japan. Infiltrate the hospital and eliminate the key staff responsible for Soders&apos; operation, as well as Yuki Yamazaki, a member of Providence&apos;s messenger corps.",
